{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-isa-42-1","title":"Isaiah 42:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The office of Christ, graced with meekness and constancy. 5 God's promise unto him. 10 An exhortation to praise God for his Gospel. 13 God will manifest himself, and check idolatry. 18 He reproves the people of incredulity.</p>\n<p>my servant. 43:10; 49:3-6; 52:13; 53:11; Mt 12:18-20; Php 2:7 whom I. 49:7,8; 50:4-9; Joh 16:32 mine elect. Ps 89:19,20; Joh 6:27; 1Pe 2:4,6 my soul. Mt 3:17; 17:5; Mr 1:11; Lu 3:22; Eph 1:4,6; Col 1:13; *marg: I have. 11:2-5; 59:21; 61:1; Mt 3:16; Mr 1:10; Lu 3:22; Joh 1:32-34; 3:34 Ac 10:38 he shall. 32:16; 49:6; Mal 1:11; Mt 12:18; Ac 9:15; 11:18; 26:17,18; 28:28 Ro 15:8-16; Eph 3:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-2","title":"Isaiah 42:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Zec 9:9; Mt 11:29; 12:16-20; Lu 17:20; 2Ti 2:24; 1Pe 2:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-3","title":"Isaiah 42:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>bruised. 35:3,4; 40:11,29-31; 50:4,10; 57:15-18; 61:1-3; 66:2; Ps 103:13,14 Ps 147:3; Jer 30:12-17; 31:18-20,25; Eze 34:16; Mt 11:28; 18:11-14 Lu 22:31,32; Joh 20:19-21,27; Heb 2:17,18 smoking. or, dimly burning. quench. Heb. quench it. heshall. 11:3,4; Ps 72:2-4; 96:13; 98:9; Mic 7:9; Joh 5:30; Re 19:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-4","title":"Isaiah 42:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>shall not. 9:7; 49:5-10; 52:13-15; 53:2-12; Joh 17:4,5; Heb 12:2-4 1Pe 2:22-24 discouraged. Heb. broken. and the isles. 12; 2:2-4; 11:9-12; 24:15,16; 41:5; 55:5; 60:9; 66:19; Ge 49:10 Ps 22:27; 72:8-11; 98:2,3; Mic 4:1-3; Zec 2:11; Ro 16:26; 1Co 9:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-5","title":"Isaiah 42:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>he that created. 40:12,22,28; 44:24; 45:12,18; 48:13; Ps 102:25,26; 104:2-35 Jer 10:12; 32:17; Am 9:6; Zec 12:1; Heb 1:2,10-12 he that spread. Ge 1:10-12,24,25; Ps 24:1,2; 136:6 he that giveth. Ge 2:7; Job 12:10; 27:3; 33:4; 34:14; Ps 33:6; Da 5:23; Ac 17:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-6","title":"Isaiah 42:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>called. 32:1; 43:1; 45:13; 49:1-3; Ps 45:6,7; Jer 23:5,6; 33:15,16 Ro 3:25,26; Heb 1:8,9; 7:2,26 and will hold. 1; 41:13 and give. 49:8; Mt 26:28; Lu 1:69-72; Ro 15:8,9; 2Co 1:20; Ga 3:15-17 Heb 8:6; 9:15; 12:24; 13:20 a light. 49:6; 51:4,5; 60:1-3; Lu 2:32; Joh 8:12; Ac 13:47; 26:23; 1Pe 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-7","title":"Isaiah 42:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>open. 16; 29:18; 35:5; Ps 146:8; Mt 11:5; Lu 24:45; Joh 9:39; Ac 26:18 2Co 4:6; Eph 1:17,18; Re 3:18 to bring. 22; 9:2; 49:9; 61:1; Ps 107:10-16; 146:7; Zec 9:11,12; Lu 4:18-21 2Ti 2:26; Heb 2:14,15; 1Pe 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-8","title":"Isaiah 42:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>that is. Ex 3:13-15; 4:5; Ps 83:18; Joh 8:58 my glory. 48:11; Ex 20:3-5; 34:14; Joh 5:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-9","title":"Isaiah 42:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>the former. Ge 15:12-16; Jos 21:45; 23:14,15; 1Ki 8:15-20; 11:36 new things. 41:22,23; 43:19; 44:7,8; 46:9,10; Joh 13:19; Ac 15:18; 1Pe 1:10-12 2Pe 1:19-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-10","title":"Isaiah 42:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Sing. 24:14-16; 44:23; 49:13; 65:14; Ps 33:3; 40:3; 96:1-3; 98:1-4; 117:1,2 Ro 15:9-11; Re 5:9; 14:3 ye that go. Ps 107:23-32; 148:1-14; 150:6 all that is therein. Heb. the fulness thereof. the isles. 4; 51:5; 60:9; Ps 97:1; Zep 2:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-11","title":"Isaiah 42:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Let the wilderness. 32:16; 35:1,6; 40:3; 41:18,19; 43:19; Ps 72:8-10 Kedar. 60:7; Ge 25:23; Ps 120:5 let the inhabitants. Jer 21:13; 48:28; 49:16; Ob 1:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-12","title":"Isaiah 42:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>24:15,16; 66:18,19; Ps 22:27; 96:3-10; 117:1,2; Ro 15:9-11 Re 5:9,10; 7:9-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-13","title":"Isaiah 42:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>as a mighty. 59:16-19; 63:1-4; Ex 15:1-3; Ps 78:65; 110:5,6; Jer 25:30 jealousy. Na 1:2; Zep 1:18; 3:8 shall cry. 31:4; Ho 11:10; Joe 3:16; Am 1:2 prevail. or, behave himself mightily. Ps 118:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-14","title":"Isaiah 42:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>long time. Job 32:18,20; Ps 50:2; 83:1,2; Ec 8:11,12; Jer 15:6; 44:22; Lu 18:7 2Pe 3:9,10,15 devour. Heb. swallow, or sup up.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-15","title":"Isaiah 42:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>2:12-16; 11:15,16; 44:27; 49:11; 50:2; Ps 18:7; 107:33,34; 114:3-7 Jer 4:24; Na 1:4-6; Hab 3:6-10; Hag 2:6; Zec 10:11; Re 6:12-17 Re 8:7-12; 11:13; 16:12,18; 20:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-16","title":"Isaiah 42:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>I will bring. 29:18,24; 30:21; 32:3; 35:5,8; 48:17; 54:13; 60:1,2,19,20 Jer 31:8,9; Ho 2:14; Lu 1:78,79; Eph 5:8 lead. 41:3; Jos 3:4; Ho 2:6 crooked. 40:4; 45:2; Ec 1:15; 7:13; Lu 3:5 straight. Heb. into straightness. and not. Ps 94:14; Jer 32:39-41; Eze 14:23; Ro 5:8-10; 8:29-31; 2Th 2:13,14 1Pe 1:3-5; Heb 13:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-17","title":"Isaiah 42:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>be greatly. 1:29; 44:11; 45:16,17; Ps 97:7; Jer 2:26,27; Hab 2:18-20 say to. 44:17; Ex 32:4,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-18","title":"Isaiah 42:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>ye deaf. 29:18; 43:8; Ex 4:11; Pr 20:12; Mr 7:34-37; Lu 7:22; Re 3:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-19","title":"Isaiah 42:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Who is blind. 6:9; 29:9-14; 56:10; Jer 4:22; 5:21; Eze 12:2; Mt 13:14,15; 15:14-16 Mt 23:16-24; Mr 8:17,18; Joh 7:47-49; 9:39,41; 12:40; Ro 2:17-23 Ro 11:7-10,25; 2Co 3:14,15; 4:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-20","title":"Isaiah 42:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>Seeing. 1:3; 48:6-8; Nu 14:22; De 4:9; 29:2-4; Ne 9:10-17; Ps 106:7-13 Ps 107:43; Joh 9:37-40; 11:37-50 opening. 58:2; Jer 42:2-5; Eze 33:31; Mr 6:19,20; Ac 28:22-27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-21","title":"Isaiah 42:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>well. 1:24-27; 46:12,13; Ps 71:16,19; 85:9-12; Da 9:24-27; Mt 3:17; 5:17 Mt 17:5; Joh 8:29; 15:10; Ro 3:25,26; 2Co 5:19-21; Php 3:9 he will. Ps 40:8; Mt 3:15; 5:17-20; Ro 3:31; 7:12; 8:3,4; 10:4; Ga 3:13,21 Ga 5:22,23; Heb 8:10; 1Jo 3:4,5 it. Heb. or, him. Joh 13:31,32; 17:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-22","title":"Isaiah 42:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>a people. 1:7; 18:2; 36:1; 52:4,5; 56:9; Jer 50:17; 51:34,35; 52:4-11 Lu 19:41-44; 21:20-24 they are all of them snared. or, in snaring all the youngmen of them. are hid. 7; 14:17; 45:13; Ps 102:20; Jer 52:31 a spoil. Heb. a treading. 51:23; De 28:29-33; Ps 50:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-23","title":"Isaiah 42:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>will give. 1:18-20; 48:18; Le 26:40-42; De 4:29-31; 32:29; Pr 1:22,23 Jer 3:4-7,13; Mic 6:9; Mt 21:28-31; Ac 3:19,22,23; 1Pe 4:2,3 time to come. Heb. after-time.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-24","title":"Isaiah 42:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>10:5,6; 45:7; 47:6; 50:1,2; 59:1,2; 63:10; De 28:49; 32:30; Jud 2:14 Jud 3:8; 10:7; 2Ch 15:6; 36:17; Ne 9:26,27; Ps 106:40-42; Jer 5:15 Jer 25:8,9; La 1:14,18; Am 3:6; Mt 22:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-42-25","title":"Isaiah 42:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":42,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":42,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>he hath poured. Le 26:15-46; De 32:22; Ps 79:5,6; Eze 7:8,9; 20:34; 22:21,22 Na 1:6; Re 16:1-21 and it hath. 2Ki 25:9 he knew. 9:13; Jer 5:3; Ho 7:9; Re 9:18-21; 16:9 yet he laid. 57:11; Mal 2:2</p>"}]}